  "description": "He K line (1s -> 2p) from a pressured He bubble formed in a tritiated PdPt matrix.\r\nThe energy of the K line depends on the pressure (here 22 eV at 0.1 Gpa) . It has to be compared to the value for an isolated atom: 21.218 eV.\r\nThe 1s->3p transition is also visible in the spectrum at 23.8 eV\r\nSee paper for details Analyst: Odile Stephan,Dario Taverna. Temperature: Room. ",
